      "acquire any source, archive or provider row",
      "fit, tune, refit or re-score any model, or create a probability, calibration or champion",
      "admit any field as PIT evidence or treat later-observed geography as historically effective",
      "claim actual travel, itinerary, routing, timezone burden, physiological rest, crowd, home-field or travel effects",
      "evaluate protected or forward seasons or release any scientific hold",
      "complete BAT-417, BAT-419, weather, personnel or any other owner scope",
      "mutate or activate any predecessor artifact or contract"
    ],
    "committed_before": "this contract is committed on the assignment branch before the first canonical write"
  },
